{"unit_id":"cloveric__deepseek-harness-web-search-plugin#card-zh","repo":"cloveric/deepseek-harness-web-search-plugin","commit":"0b1c1b625f16df39c81c510a9f3afb641ef8118d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness Web Search Plugin 为 DSH web profile 提供网页搜索和页面抽取。它注入搜索指引，并经 stdio MCP 提供 web_search、web_extract、provider_status 和 health_check；另注册 /tarocub 配置指引命令。搜索支持 Brave/Tavily 顺序回退或双路核验，返回来源信息；抽取读取指定的 HTTP(S) 网址。适合查找实时网页资料、核对来源和读取页面正文。按需配置 BRAVE_API_KEY 或 TAVILY_API_KEY，搜索和抽取请求会发送给对应供应商。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:22-35","src/search-mcp-server.ts:629-687","src/search-router.ts:90-210","src/search-providers.ts:115-262"]}
